    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "end the performance? what does that even mean. you mean just giving up? because honestly, everything is so draining. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i don't have to keep doing this anymore. like, is there even a point in trying to \"find myself\" if that person is already dead?",
